2. Create an `XContentBuilder` instance that will hold the serialized mapping.  
3. Call the helper function `RootObjectMapper_doXContent` (the one you mentioned) with the two arguments you need – the builder and a list of flags.  
4. Print the resulting JSON so you can see what the mapping looks like.

